The fees are configured in the `chainConfig` in the `feeConfig` field:

```json
{
  "config": {
    // ...
    "feeConfig": { // [!code highlight]
      "gasLimit": 15000000,
      "minBaseFee": 25000000000,
      "targetGas": 15000000,
      "baseFeeChangeDenominator": 36,
      "minBlockGasCost": 0,
