  console.log("Public Key:", evmAccount.publicKey);
}
```

### XP Account

Each Avalanche account contains an XP account for X-Chain and P-Chain operations:

```typescript

  AvalancheAccount,
  LocalXPAccount,
} from "@avalanche-sdk/client/accounts";

