## prepareAddAutoRenewedValidatorTxn

Prepare a transaction to add an auto-renewed validator (ACP-236) to the Primary Network. The validator automatically starts a new validation cycle of length `period` at each cycle boundary and can compound a configurable share of its rewards. Renewal happens only if the validator met its uptime requirement for the cycle (90% for Primary Network validators); otherwise it is removed from the validator set at the cycle boundary, its staked funds unlock, and the reward for that cycle is forfeited.

  ACP-236 transactions require the Helicon upgrade — active on Fuji from July 28, 2026 at 15:00 UTC, and not yet scheduled on Mainnet.

**Function Signature:**

```typescript
function prepareAddAutoRenewedValidatorTxn(
  params: PrepareAddAutoRenewedValidatorTxnParameters
): Promise;

interface PrepareAddAutoRenewedValidatorTxnParameters {
  nodeId: string;
  stakeInNanoAvax: bigint;
  period: bigint;
  publicKey: string;
  signature: string;
  rewardAddresses: string[];
  delegatorRewardAddresses: string[];
  ownerAddresses: string[];
  delegatorRewardPercentage: number;
  autoCompoundRewardPercentage: number;
  threshold?: number;
  locktime?: bigint;
  fromAddresses?: string[];
  changeAddresses?: string[];
  utxos?: Utxo[];
  memo?: string;
  minIssuanceTime?: bigint;
  context?: Context;
}

interface PrepareAddAutoRenewedValidatorTxnReturnType {
  tx: UnsignedTx;
  addAutoRenewedValidatorTx: AddAutoRenewedValidatorTx;
  chainAlias: "P";
}
```

**Parameters:**

const autoRenewedValidatorTx =
  await walletClient.pChain.prepareAddAutoRenewedValidatorTxn({
    nodeId: "NodeID-7Xhw2mDxuDS44j42TCB6U5579esbSt3Lg",
    stakeInNanoAvax: avaxToNanoAvax(2000),
    period: 14n * 24n * 60n * 60n,
    publicKey:
      "0x85025bca6a302dc61338ff49c8baa572ded3e86f3759304c7f618a2a2593c187e080a3cfdec95040309ad1f158953067",
    signature:
      "0x8b1d6133d17e3483220ad960b6fde11e4e1214a8ce21ef616227e5d5eef070d7500e6f7d4452c5a760620cc06795cbe218e072eba76d94788d9d01176ce4ecadfb96b47f942281894ddfadd1c1743f7f549f1d07d59d55655927f72bc6bf7c12",
    rewardAddresses: ["P-fuji19fc97zn3mzmwr827j4d3n45refkksgms4y2yzz"],
    delegatorRewardAddresses: ["P-fuji19fc97zn3mzmwr827j4d3n45refkksgms4y2yzz"],
    ownerAddresses: ["P-fuji19fc97zn3mzmwr827j4d3n45refkksgms4y2yzz"],
